<aside class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-5"><h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-950">Account creation and access safety</h2><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-amber-900">AuthService supports direct staff account creation with a required initial password of at least 12 characters. It does not support invitations, staff profile edits, or password resets. Deactivation and administrator demotion revoke refresh tokens. Already-issued access tokens remain valid until their 15-minute expiry; the current authentication model has no access-token revocation endpoint. The service blocks self-deactivation, self-demotion, and changes that would leave no active administrator.</p></aside>
